        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <!-- PROTECTIVE BELT — FORMS                                      -->
    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <section class="schema-tier pb-form">
      <p class="tier-label">Protective Belt — Forms</p>
      <h2>The three Forms (PB-Form-1 through PB-Form-3)</h2>
      <p class="tier-desc">Operationalizable structural frameworks. Each is the corpus's primary articulation of a recurring pattern; each is open to revision in response to operational-tier failure; revision does not require revision of the hard core.</p>
      <div class="doc-cards">
