    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <!-- OBSERVATIONAL PREDICTIONS                                    -->
    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <section class="schema-tier observational">
      <p class="tier-label">Observational Predictions</p>
      <h2>Operational claims and the build specifications that test them</h2>
      <p class="tier-desc">OP1 substrate-and-keeper composition exhibits SIPE-T per-step; OP2 hedge-pattern detection per Pin-Art; OP3 coherent confabulation surfaces real correspondences; OP4 dyadic outputs distinguishable from non-dyadic; OP5 cross-domain pattern recognition above chance; OP6 corpus operates coherently within SIPE-T at meta-level.</p>
