    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <!-- ACTIVE EXTENSIONS — recent self-articulation cluster         -->
    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <section class="schema-tier extension">
      <p class="tier-label">Active Extensions — Self-Articulation Phase (621–633)</p>
      <h2>The recent integration cluster — corpus-self-recognition work</h2>
      <p class="tier-desc">The 13-doc cluster from late April–early May 2026 in which the corpus achieved its self-recognition as Lakatosian programme + SIPE-T meta-level instance. Each doc extends a Form, supplies a discipline elaboration, or surfaces a meta-level finding.</p>
